NOTE ON ART ASSETS:
The MIT license above covers the source code. Visual assets are licensed
separately — all are free to redistribute:

- Character sprites (hero + orcs, in assets/karakterler/ and embedded in the
  HTML files) are original, procedurally generated pixel art created with the
  project's own "Pixel Hero Maker" tool. Released under CC0 (public domain).
- Enemy sprites (goblin/imp/ogre, assets/dusmanlar/), weapon and coin icons
  (assets/ikonlar/): 0x72 "DungeonTileset II" — CC0.

See CREDITS in README.md for details.
